      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hard, hard, *hard* pass.\n\nI don't want to see generative AI touch VRChat - a platform that flourishes from the toil and passion of vastly talented and skilled living artists - in any way, shape or form.\n\nVRChat typically boasts 50,000 daily peak concurrent users. We do not need a single one of those to be replaced by a robot designed to deceive you it cares.",
