  "details": "So lately, i noticed a lot of my Friends are not really actively playing VRChat anymore. Which is relatable since we grow older, getting married, having kids, what not.\n\nSo for the lonely days when your VRChat Friends aren't online, a AI Companion would be nice to have.\n\nIt could talk to you, explore worlds with you, helping you solve Mazes or Riddles. And it would also be a nice gimmick if you could change its appearance by buying user made \"skins\" from the in game shop with VR-Credits.",
